config WING_RUST
	tristate "Wing clean shell (Rust)"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable the clean Wing shell. This version intentionally starts with a
		small framebuffer demo kernel and avoids the previous prototype's app,
		resource, PTY, and SDK layers.

